       "content": "# Service Catalogue\n## Data, Data Management, Automation & AI Consultancy\n\n---\n\n# 1. Executive Overview\n\nWe are a consultancy specialising in data strategy, data management, automation, and artificial intelligence. While Microsoft 365 and the broader Microsoft ecosystem form a significant part of our practice, our expertise extends across the full technology landscape. We help organisations unlock the value of their data, streamline operations through intelligent automation, and responsibly adopt AI \u2014 grounded in governance, security, and measurable business outcomes.\n\n---\n\n# 2. Service Domains\n\n## 2.1 Data Strategy & Governance\n\n### 2.1.1 Data Maturity Assessment\nA comprehensive evaluation of your organisation's current data capabilities across people, processes, technology, and governance.\n\n**What we deliver:**\n- Current-state maturity scoring across defined dimensions\n- Benchmarking against industry peers\n- Gap analysis with prioritised recommendations\n- Executive summary and detailed findings report\n\n**M365 context:** Assessment of SharePoint, OneDrive, Lists, Power BI, Purview, and Microsoft Graph data utilisation.\n\n**Beyond",
